{
  "chapter": "STEAM_AGE",
  "description": 'Here are some more GregTech tools you will need as you go on.

§aWrenches§r: Mainly used to rotate blocks, craft many items, and connect pipes. Also used to mine normally breaking casings.

§aHammer§r: Used in many crafting recipes and to make dusts.

§aMortars§r: The best tool for crafting dusts, but consider using the §3Steam Grinder§r instead to save resources.

§aScrewdriver§r: Used to change world accel modes, tell drums to empty into pipes, and work with machine covers.

§aWirecutters§r: The main tool for making wires before the wiremill. Also used to "cut" wires for better power management, which becomes very useful later.',
